  "notes": "Three channels of the quad function generator set to cycle with their outputs going to modulate three aspects of the complex oscillator sound. To bury the sound adjust the knobs and controls of the oscillator as well as  the attack and decay knobs of channel ABNC of the function generator. If you don't hear sound, go to the mixer and click the engine and/or the master button to turn them on, or press the space bar to toggle.",
